# api call for trainer registration
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/accounts/trainer/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"trainer3",
    "email":"trainer3@gmail.come",
    "password":"trainer3@123",
    "phone":789486127
}

